 two older sisters. (I love them very much)\n\n\n                If necessary, correct or make improvements  to these sentences. If they are already correct,\n                write\n                   There’s something which | should tell you.\n\n                   The doctor whom  Ingrid went to see was very thorough.\n                   Yesterday was the hottest day | can remember.\n                   There isn’t much can go wrong with the machine.\n                   Thieves whom  stole paintings from Notford art gallery have been arrested in Paris.\n                   It may be the most important decision which you will ever take.\n                   The boy took the photograph was paid £100.\n                   | heard many different accents in the room, but none which | could identify as Polish.\n                   He just said anything which came into his head.\n                   There’s this dream which | have every night about falling downstairs.\n\n\n         > Additional exercise 11 (page 247)                                                                    107", "char_count": 3018, "mean_conf": 91.72, "word_count": 417, "words": [{"text": "Exercises", "x0": 166, "y0": 81, "x1": 485, "y1": 143, "conf": 96, "bold": true}, {"text": "Put", "x0": 304, "y0": 215, "x1": 363, "y1": 244, "conf": 96, "bold": true}, {"text": "brackets", "x0": 376, "y0": 213, "x1": 526, "y1": 244, "conf": 95, "bold": true}, {"text": "around", "x0": 538, "y0": 213, "x1": 663, "y1": 244, "conf": 95, "bold": false}, {"text": "the", "x0": 675, "y0": 213, "x1": 734, "y1": 244, "conf": 96, "bold": true}, {"text": "italicised", "x0": 747, "y0": 213, "x1": 904, "y1": 245, "conf": 96, "bold": true}, {"text": "relative", "x0": 918, "y0": 214, "x1": 1052, "y1": 245, "conf": 96, "bold": true}, {"text": "pronoun", "x0": 1064, "y0": 223, "x1": 1213, "y1": 254, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "if", "x0": 1227, "y0": 214, "x1": 1250, "y1": 244, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "it", "x0